                            <img src="https://res.wx.qq.com/open/zh_CN/htmledition/res/img/pic/slider/icon_arrow7e8b25.svg" class="encounter_problem_detail_item_top_icon" />
                        </div>
                        <p class="encounter_problem_detail_item_tip">向在线客服咨询问题</p>
                    </div>
                </a>
